</table></a><br>
<table border="0" width="100%">
<tr>
<td  bgcolor="#00FFCC"><strong><a href="mailto:gedoh@gundam.com" target="_blank">神崎亮</a></strong>  <i>2000/05/18 00:32:45</i><br></td>
<td bgcolor="#00CCFF" width="10%" align="center" nowrap>
